      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Swedish government offices to ban ChatGPT and Claude",
      "url": "https://www.sverigesradio.se/artikel/chat-gpt-och-claude-forbjuder-regeringskansliet",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50207405",
      "score": 322,
      "comments": 122,
      "author": "armcat",
      "published": "2026-10-23T11:39:54Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Sweden's public administration restricts US-hosted AI SaaS tools (OpenAI, Anthropic) over foreign espionage risks, GDPR compliance, and classified data leakage.",
        "The move accelerates public sector shifts toward self-hosted open-weight LLMs (e.g., Mistral, Llama) deployed on sovereign on-prem infrastructure.",
        "Security teams handling European public contracts must increasingly avoid multi-tenant third-party APIs for processing sensitive operational data."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
